"stem": "<p>A group of students conducted an experiment using materials, A, B and C, of the same size. One end of each material was dipped into a container with blue-coloured water as shown.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/EOY_ACSJ/q17_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Materials A, B and C are of the same size, with one end dipped in blue water and held by a stand.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>They measured the distance that the blue-coloured water travelled up each material at the end of experiment.<br>Which of the following is a possible aim of their experiment?</p>",
