"stem": "<p>(a) How many stages does a flowering plant have in its life cycle? [1]<br>The table below describes the life cycle of three animals, P, Q and R. A '✓' indicates that the characteristic is present in the life cycle of the animal while a '×' indicates that the characteristic is absent.<br>(b) State a similarity between the life cycle of animal P and R. [1]<br>The picture below shows a frog.<br>(c) Based on the characteristics stated in the table, which animal, P, Q or R, best represents a frog as shown above? Explain your answer. [2]</p>\n<figure>- Diagram:<img src=\"images/EOY_MahaBodhi/q34_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Characteristics table — Young resembles the adult: P=✓, Q=×, R=×; Has three stages in its life cycle: P=✓, Q=×, R=✓.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>- Diagram:<img src=\"images/EOY_MahaBodhi/q34_fig2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>A frog.</figcaption></figure>",
