"topicRaw": "Animal Life Cycles",
"topic": "Life Cycles",
"subtopic": "Animal Life Cycles",
"difficulty": 4,
"kw": "",
"stem": "<p>The graph below shows the length of time for some stages in the life cycles of organisms P and Q. (a) State two similarities between the two life cycles. (Do not name the stages in the life cycles.) [2] (b) Based on the graph above, if organisms P and Q lay their eggs at the same time, at what stage will organisms P and Q be on Day 14? [2] P: ________ stage Q: ________ stage</p>\n<figure>- <img src=\"images/EOY_NanHua/q28_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Bar chart (unit: number of days) — egg: P 2 days, Q 8 days; larva: P 6 days, Q 12 days; pupa: P 4 days, Q 14 days (white bars are Q, shaded bars are P)</figcaption></figure>",
"options": [],
"myAnswer": "(a) Similarity 1: Both life cycles have four stages. Similarity 2: The young do not resemble the adults. (可替代：Both spend the least number of days in the egg stage.) (b) P: adult stage (2+6+4=12 天完成前三阶段，第 14 天已进入成虫期)；Q: larva stage (egg 8 天 + larva 至第 20 天，第 14 天处于幼虫期)",
