"stem": "<p>Lishan keeps an egg of insect M in a tank. She places 40 leaves inside. She records how the egg turns into an adult insect in the table below. Stage / Number of leaves at the start of each stage / Number of leaves at the end of each stage: egg 40/40; adult 40/40; S 40/40; T 40/5. (a) Based on the table above, draw the life cycle of insect M using 'egg', 'adult', 'S' and 'T', in the box below. [1] (b) Why does the number of leaves in the tank remain the same when the insect is at the adult stage? [1]</p>",
"options": [],
"myAnswer": "(a) 循环Diagram：egg → T → S → adult → egg（T=larva 吃叶子，S=pupa 不吃）。等等——按官方答案为 egg→T→S→adult。即 T 是 larva（吃叶，40→5），S 是 pupa（不吃叶）。所以顺序：egg → T(larva) → S(pupa) → adult。(b) The adult insect does not feed on leaves.",
"answer": "(a) Official cycle diagram: egg → T → S → adult (cycle). (b) The adult insect does not feed on leaves.",
"keypoints": "(a) egg → T → S → adult\n(a) adult does not feed on / does not eat leaves (the adult does not eat leaves)",
