"stem": "<p>The picture below shows a potted plant in the garden. [Figure: a garden with a watering can, a butterfly, a plant and a flower pot] Joan classified the things in the picture into two groups, A and B. [Table: Group A: plant, butterfly; Group B: watering can, flower pot] (a) Write suitable headings for the two groups. [1] Group A: ______ things; Group B: ______ things. The pictures below show the same pot of plant at three different timings of the day. [Figure: the plant facing different directions at 8 a.m., 12 p.m. and 6 p.m.] (b) Based on your observation, what is the characteristic of living things that the plant has shown from 8 a.m. to 6 p.m.? [1]</p>\n<figure>- <img src=\"images/EOY_Rosyth/q25_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>A watering can, a butterfly, a plant, a flower pot</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>- <img src=\"images/EOY_Rosyth/q25_fig2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The plant (flower) faces different directions at 8 a.m., 12 p.m. and 6 p.m.</figcaption></figure>",
