"stem": "<p>Study the flowchart of three living things, X, Y and Z, below. [Figure: Living things → Does it lay eggs? no→X; yes → Can it fly? yes→Y; no → Does it have moist skin? yes→Z] (a) State one difference between X and Y. [1] (b) Which living thing, X, Y or Z, is an amphibian? Give a reason. [1]</p>\n<figure>- <img src=\"images/EOY_Rosyth/q26_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The animals are sorted into X, Y and Z according to whether they lay eggs, can fly, and have moist skin</figcaption></figure>",
