"stem": "<p>Kelly conducted some experiments to find out the properties of materials E, G and H. The results are shown in the table below.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/EOY_StHilda/q29_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p>Caption: Breaks easily: E-No, G-No, H-Yes; Floats on water: E-Yes, G-No, H-No; Bends easily without breaking: E-No, G-No, H-No</p>\n<p>Based on the information in the table, which materials E, G or H is most suitable to make the objects shown below? Fill in the correct answer.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/EOY_StHilda/q29_fig2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p>Caption: Object / Material (E, G or H) table: metal nail clipper, wooden raft, ceramic vase</p>",
