"options": [],
"myAnswer": "Strength.\nStrip A is stronger than strip B.\nStrip A. Strip A did not tear while strip B tore when the heavy stone was hung on the strips. Strip A is a stronger material than strip B, hence a grocery bag made of A will not tear easily when carrying heavy grocery.\nIt must be flexible.",
