"stem": "<p>Vera wanted to observe the germination of seeds. She placed five seeds into each of the two set-ups A and B as shown below. She placed set-up A in a dark room and set-up B under a light in a room.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/EOY_StNicholas/q31_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p>(a) What is the aim of her experiment? [1]<br>(b) In the table below, tick (✓) the variables that she is measuring for her experiment to be fair. [1]</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/EOY_StNicholas/q31_fig2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p>(c) Give a reason why Vera placed damp cotton wool into both containers. [1]</p>",
