"kw": "",
"stem": "<p>Andy wanted to use a bar magnet to magnetise an iron nail as shown below.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/EOY_StNicholas/q33_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p>(a) Explain how Andy should stroke the iron nail to magnetise it. [2]</p>\n<p>Andy stroked the iron nail with the bar magnet and brought it near some steel pins as shown in the diagram below.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/EOY_StNicholas/q33_fig2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p>He recorded his observations in the table below.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/EOY_StNicholas/q33_fig3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p>(b) What is the relationship between the number of strokes and the magnetic strength of the iron nail? [1]</p>",
"options": [],
