"stem": "<p>Janet had two similar plants, R and S, as shown in the diagram below. She cut off all the roots of plant S but not the roots of plant R. She then put both pots of plants in the garden.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/EOY_MGS/q9_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Two potted plants: plant R (roots were not cut off) and plant S (roots were all cut off).</figcaption></figure>\n<p>After a thunderstorm, one of the two plants fell out of the pot. Which plant fell out and why?</p>",
