"stem": "<p>Miran took a plant, watered it and then placed it in a wooden box as shown.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA1_ACSJ/q4_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Diagram 5: A potted plant placed inside a wooden box (labels: wooden box, plant); there is no light inside the box.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>(a) She made a hole in the wooden box. After a few days, she observed that the plant grew towards one side as shown. In the diagram below, put a tick (✓) in the box where the hole had been made. [1]</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA1_ACSJ/q4_fig2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Diagram 6: The box has three empty slots on the top, left and right; the plant inside the box grows bent towards the right.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>(b) State the characteristic of living things shown by the plant. [1]</p>",
