"stem": "<p>Mei Ling placed a rat in a container with a bowl of water as shown.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA1_ACSJ/q5_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Diagram 7: A sealed container (cover with holes, container) containing a rat and a water bowl; there is no food inside the container.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>(a) Why are there holes on the cover of the container? [1]<br>(b) What will happen to the rat after ten days? Give a reason based on the characteristics of living things. [1]<br>(c) Classify 'bowl', 'water' and 'rat' in the table. [1]</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td>Non-living things</td><td>Living things</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>",
