"stem": "<p>Study the pictures below. How are the living things classified in groups C and D?</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA1_TaoNan/q3_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Group C = flowering plants (rose, coconut tree); Group D = mushroom and mould (fungi, without leaves or stems, reproducing by spores)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA1_TaoNan/q3_fig2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Option table — comparing the characteristics of Group C and Group D</figcaption></figure>\n<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td>C</td><td>D</td></tr><tr><td>(1)</td><td>Has leaves and stem</td><td>Does not have leaves and stem</td></tr><tr><td>(2)</td><td>Reproduce from spores</td><td>Reproduce from seeds</td></tr><tr><td>(3)</td><td>Flowering plants</td><td>Non-flowering plants</td></tr><tr><td>(4)</td><td>Unable to make their own food</td><td>Able to make their own food</td></tr></tbody></table>",
