"stem": "<p>Study the classification chart below.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA1_TaoNan/q8_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Group G = flowering plants (coconut tree, papaya tree); Group H = ferns (non-flowering plants)</figcaption></figure>\n<p>(a) Suggest suitable headings for Groups G and H. [1]</p>\n<p>Group G: ______________<br>Group H: ______________</p>\n<p>Asha found a plant in her garden and did not see any flowers on it. She concluded that the plant is a non-flowering plant.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA1_TaoNan/q8_fig2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The plant found by Asha: has a weak stem and grows upwards with the help of support</figcaption></figure>\n<p>(b) Are all plants which do not have flowers considered non-flowering plants? Explain your answer. [1]</p>",
