"stem": "<p>Answer the following questions based on the flow chart.</p>\n<p>(a) The pictures show a salamander and a mudskipper. Which letter, W, X, Y or Z, best represents the salamander and mudskipper? [1]<br>Salamander: ______<br>Mudskipper: ______</p>\n<p>(b) State the characteristics of animal W. [1]</p>\n<p>(c) (i) Which animal group does animal Z most likely belong to? [½]</p>\n<p>The picture shows a spider.<br>(ii) Based on the picture, explain why the spider does not belong to the same animal group as animal Z. [½]</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA2_ACSJ/q2_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Classification flowchart — Animals → Does it breathe through lungs? (No → Does it have hard outer covering? Yes → Z / No → Y; Yes → Does it have wings? No → X / Yes → W)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA2_ACSJ/q2_fig2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Pictures of a salamander and a mudskipper</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA2_ACSJ/q2_fig3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Picture of a spider</figcaption></figure>",
"options": [],
