"stem": "<p>Jimmy wanted to find out which of three metal bars, AB, CD and EF are magnets. He hung each bar from a string and brought them near to each other. His results are shown below.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA2_MahaBodhi/q8_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Four set-ups: hanging strips AB and CD brought close to each other (two orientations), and AB and EF brought close to each other (two orientations), observing the swinging/deflection results.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Which one of the following describes each metal bar correctly?</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA2_MahaBodhi/q8_fig2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Option table: four combinations of whether AB / CD / EF are a magnet or not a magnet.</figcaption></figure>",
