"stem": "<p>Jimmy studied the groups of animals below.<br>（Group A：bird（sparrow）、chicken；Group B：bat、rabbit；Group C：frog、salamander/newt）<br>How are the animals grouped?</p>\n<figure>- <img src=\"images/WA2_NanHua/q3_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Diagram: Q3 table of three groups of animals (Group A: bird and chicken, Group B: bat and rabbit, Group C: frog and salamander)</figcaption></figure>",
