"stem": "<p>Study the flow chart below.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA3_AiTong/q9_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Flowchart — Animals → Does it have a 4-stage life cycle? (Yes → Group X; No → Does its young look similar to the adult? Yes → Group Y, No → Group Z).</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Based on the flow chart above, state the group, X, Y or Z that each of the following animals belongs to. [2]</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td>Animal</td><td>Group</td></tr><tr><td>chicken</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>beetle</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>frog</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>grasshopper</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>",
