"stem": "<p>Mr Kong placed three rings, A, B and C into a holder. The rings came to rest in the positions as shown in the diagram below.<br>Based on the diagram, which of the rings are definitely magnets?</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA3_Rosyth/q2_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>",
