"kw": "",
"stem": "<p>Vera placed a U-shaped magnet near some pins. She recorded the number of pins attracted to the different parts of the magnet in the graph below.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA3_StNicholas/q18_fig1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p>(a) Based on the graph, label parts A, B and C of the U-shaped magnet in the boxes below. [1]</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA3_StNicholas/q18_fig2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p>(b) Based on the graph, what can she conclude from this experiment? [1]</p>\n<p>Vera made a toy car using a bar magnet. When she moved the U-shaped magnet towards the toy car, she observed that the toy car moved away.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"images/WA3_StNicholas/q18_fig3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p>(c) Explain why the toy car moved away from the U-shaped magnet. [1]</p>",
"figAnswer": {"fig": 1, "exact": true, "parts": {"a": "text"}, "boxes": [{"id": "top", "part": "a", "x": 71, "y": 5, "w": 12, "h": 10, "expect": "B", "zone": {"x": 64, "y": 0, "w": 26, "h": 22}, "span": "Top box = B"}, {"id": "left", "part": "a", "x": 13, "y": 36, "w": 12, "h": 10, "expect": "A", "zone": {"x": 6, "y": 26, "w": 26, "h": 31}, "span": "Left box = A"}, {"id": "right", "part": "a", "x": 80, "y": 37, "w": 12, "h": 10, "expect": "C", "zone": {"x": 73, "y": 27, "w": 26, "h": 30}, "span": "Right box = C"}]},
"options": [],
"myAnswer": "(a) 顶部框=B（磁极一端）；左框=A（弯曲中部）；右框=C（磁极另一端）\n  (b) The magnetic strength is strongest at the two poles (ends) of the magnet.\n  (c) The like poles of the two magnets were facing each other, so they repelled and the car moved away.",
